  "questions": [
    {
      "id": "q1",
      "number": 1,
      "type": "single",
      "topic": {
        "en": "Computer Number Systems",
        "zh": "计算机数字系统"
      },
      "statement": {
        "en": "What is the base 16 equivalent for $41375_{8}$?",
        "zh": "如何用十六进制表示八进制数 $41375_{8}$?"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": {
            "en": "$42FD_{16}$",
            "zh": "$42FD_{16}$"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": {
            "en": "$413FA_{16}$",
            "zh": "$413FA_{16}$"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": {
            "en": "$85F5_{16}$",
            "zh": "$85F5_{16}$"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": {
            "en": "$42DF_{16}$",
            "zh": "$42DF_{16}$"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "text": {
            "en": "$4300_{16}$",
            "zh": "$4300_{16}$"
          }
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionIds": [
        "A"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "en": "Answer: **A**.\n\nEach octal digit represents three bits. Expand the five digits as `100 001 011 111 101`, then regroup into fours from the right: `0100 0010 1111 1101`. The leftmost group was padded with a zero. The groups give `4, 2, F, D`, so the result is $42FD_{16}$.",
        "zh": "答案：**A**。\n\n八进制每位对应三位二进制，依次展开为 `100 001 011 111 101`。从右往左每四位重新分组，在最左侧补一个 0，得到 `0100 0010 1111 1101`。各组对应 `4、2、F、D`，结果为 $42FD_{16}$。"
      },
      "source": {
        "statementSource": "statement",
        "statementPages": [
          1,
          2
        ],
        "solutionSource": "solution",
        "solutionPages": [
          1
        ],
        "answerProvenance": "official"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "q2",
      "number": 2,
      "type": "single",
      "topic": {
        "en": "Computer Number Systems",
        "zh": "计算机数字系统"
      },
      "statement": {
        "en": "Which of the following is the smallest number?\n\n$$\n100101110_{2}\\qquad 457_{8}\\qquad 12D_{16}\n$$",
        "zh": "下列数值中最小的是?\n\n$$\n100101110_{2}\\qquad 457_{8}\\qquad 12D_{16}\n$$"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": {
            "en": "$100101110_{2}$",
            "zh": "$100101110_{2}$"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": {
            "en": "$457_{8}$",
            "zh": "$457_{8}$"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": {
            "en": "$12D_{16}$",
            "zh": "$12D_{16}$"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": {
            "en": "2 of them are the smallest",
            "zh": "其中两个数值最小"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "text": {
            "en": "all 3 are the same",
            "zh": "三个数值大小都一样"
          }
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionIds": [
        "C"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "en": "Answer: **C**.\n\nCompare the values in the same base. Group $100101110_2$ from the right into fours to get `0001 0010 1110`, or $12E_{16}$. Expand $457_8$ as `100 101 111` and regroup into fours to get $12F_{16}$. The three hexadecimal values share the prefix `12`, so compare $D<E<F$. The smallest is $12D_{16}$.",
        "zh": "答案：**C**。\n\n把三项换成同一种进制再比较。$100101110_2=456_8=12E_{16}$，$457_8=12F_{16}$。于是只需比较十六进制的 $12D$、$12E$ 和 $12F$，前两位相同，末位 $D<E<F$，所以 $12D_{16}$ 最小。"
      },
      "source": {
