    {
      "id": "q3",
      "number": 3,
      "type": "single",
      "topic": {
        "en": "Computer Number Systems",
        "zh": "计算机数字系统"
      },
      "statement": {
        "en": "Evaluate: $6023_{8}$ + $757_{8}$ + $1757_{8}$ Express the answer in octal.",
        "zh": "计算 $6023_{8}$ + $757_{8}$ + $1757_{8}$并将计算结果用八进制表示。"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": {
            "en": "$8759_{8}$",
            "zh": "$8759_{8}$"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": {
            "en": "$10761_{8}$",
            "zh": "$10761_{8}$"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": {
            "en": "$10527_{8}$",
            "zh": "$10527_{8}$"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": {
            "en": "$1761_{8}$",
            "zh": "$1761_{8}$"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "text": {
            "en": "$10771_{8}$",
            "zh": "$10771_{8}$"
          }
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionIds": [
        "B"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "en": "Add the first two numbers in base 8. The units total 10 in decimal, so write 2 and carry 1. The next two columns each total 8, carrying into the thousands column.\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{rcccc}\n & {\\scriptstyle 1} & {\\scriptstyle 1} & {\\scriptstyle 1} &  \\\\\n & 6 & 0 & 2 & 3 \\\\\n+ &   & 7 & 5 & 7 \\\\\n\\hline\n & 7 & 0 & 0 & 2\n\\end{array}\n$$\n\nAdd the third number to that subtotal. In the leftmost occupied column, $7+1=10_8$, so a new leading digit appears.\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{rccccc}\n &  &  &  & {\\scriptstyle 1} &  \\\\\n &   & 7 & 0 & 0 & 2 \\\\\n+ &   & 1 & 7 & 5 & 7 \\\\\n\\hline\n & 1 & 0 & 7 & 6 & 1\n\\end{array}\n$$\n\nThe total is $10761_8$ (option B).",
        "zh": "先把前两个八进制数相加。个位和为十进制 10，写 2 进 1。接下来的两列都恰好满 8，继续向左进位。\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{rcccc}\n & {\\scriptstyle 1} & {\\scriptstyle 1} & {\\scriptstyle 1} &  \\\\\n & 6 & 0 & 2 & 3 \\\\\n+ &   & 7 & 5 & 7 \\\\\n\\hline\n & 7 & 0 & 0 & 2\n\\end{array}\n$$\n\n再加上第三个数。最左侧的有效列 $7+1=10_8$，结果多出一个最高位。\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{rccccc}\n &  &  &  & {\\scriptstyle 1} &  \\\\\n &   & 7 & 0 & 0 & 2 \\\\\n+ &   & 1 & 7 & 5 & 7 \\\\\n\\hline\n & 1 & 0 & 7 & 6 & 1\n\\end{array}\n$$\n\n总和为 $10761_8$，选 B。"
      },
