    {
      "id": "q4",
      "number": 4,
      "type": "single",
      "topic": {
        "en": "Computer Number Systems",
        "zh": "计算机数字系统"
      },
      "statement": {
        "en": "How many more 1’s are there in the binary numbers from $26_{10}$ to $35_{10}$ than the binary numbers from $16_{10}$ to $25_{10}$?",
        "zh": "把从 $26_{10}$ 到 $35_{10}$ 的十进制数和从 $16_{10}$ 到 $25_{10}$ 的十进制数分别转换为二进制的表示形式后,前者含有数字1的总个数与后者含有数字1的总个数相差多少?"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": {
            "en": "4",
            "zh": "4"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": {
            "en": "5",
            "zh": "5"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": {
            "en": "6",
            "zh": "6"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": {
            "en": "7",
            "zh": "7"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "text": {
            "en": "8",
            "zh": "8"
          }
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionIds": [
        "C"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "en": "Answer: **C**.\n\n| Decimal | Binary | Decimal | Binary |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 16 | 10000 | 26 | 11010 |\n| 17 | 10001 | 27 | 11011 |\n| 18 | 10010 | 28 | 11100 |\n| 19 | 10011 | 29 | 11101 |\n| 20 | 10100 | 30 | 11110 |\n| 21 | 10101 | 31 | 11111 |\n| 22 | 10110 | 32 | 100000 |\n| 23 | 10111 | 33 | 100001 |\n| 24 | 11000 | 34 | 100010 |\n| 25 | 11001 | 35 | 100011 |\n\nThere are 25 ones from 16 to 25 and 31 ones from 26 to 35. The difference is $31-25=6$.\n\nSource correction: the original solution labels $11110_2$ as 31; it represents 30.",
        "zh": "答案：**C**。\n\n把区间两端都算进去，逐个统计二进制表示中 1 的个数。16 至 25 的计数依次为 1、2、2、3、2、3、3、4、2、3，共 25 个。26 至 35 的计数依次为 3、4、3、4、4、5、1、2、2、3，共 31 个。相差 $31-25=6$。原解析把 $11110_2$ 标成了 31，实际等于 30。"
      },
