    {
      "id": "q5",
      "number": 5,
      "type": "single",
      "topic": {
        "en": "Computer Number Systems",
        "zh": "计算机数字系统"
      },
      "statement": {
        "en": "What is the positive difference between the hexadecimal values of the blue components represented by the color values $25A8F6_{16}$ and $C2D9AB_{16}$?",
        "zh": "由十六进制数 $25A8F6_{16}$ 和 $C2D9AB_{16}$ 表示的颜色值,其中代表蓝色部分的差值是多少?"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": {
            "en": "$4B_{16}$",
            "zh": "$4B_{16}$"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": {
            "en": "$2A_{16}$",
            "zh": "$2A_{16}$"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": {
            "en": "$9D_{16}$",
            "zh": "$9D_{16}$"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": {
            "en": "$45_{16}$",
            "zh": "$45_{16}$"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "text": {
            "en": "$5B_{16}$",
            "zh": "$5B_{16}$"
          }
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionIds": [
        "A"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "en": "Answer: **A**.\n\nRGB colors use the final two hexadecimal digits for blue. The blue components are $F6_{16}$ and $AB_{16}$, so their difference is $F6_{16}-AB_{16}=4B_{16}$.",
        "zh": "答案：**A**。\n\nRGB 颜色按 `RR GG BB` 分成三组，只取最后一组蓝色。两项的蓝色值为 $F6_{16}$ 和 $AB_{16}$。个位不够减，从高位借 1 个 16，得 $22-11=11$，即 B；高位得 $14-10=4$，所以差为 $4B_{16}$。"
      },
